# --- Tools in use (10-24: a tool given earlier in the storyline is used again here, for optional finds): the
# machete from Triangulation Rocks cuts the vines over a hidden chest, and a zipline from the ridge top is the quick way back down
# (G2 10-30: the near end's floor stood 7.5 m over the ridge's west slope - a ZiplinePath_Landmark's near floor sits
# 5.7 m west and 0.9 m north of its pivot, 1.35 m under an explicit h (cszip). Pivot moved so the floor lies on the
# flat ridge top, ground 12.1 there)
clear from 22.3 43.95 to 12 17 r=2.5
place ZiplinePath_Landmark ridgezip at 28.0 43.05 h=13.45
